{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05499","headline":"和崔会稽咏王兵曹厅前涌泉势城中字 · 包融","name":"和崔会稽咏王兵曹厅前涌泉势城中字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茂德来徵应，流泉入咏歌。\n含灵符上善，作字表中和。\n有草恒垂露，无风欲偃波。\n爲看人共水，清白定谁多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}